{
  "_readme": [
    "Edit this file to add or remove cheats. No code changes needed.",
    "match  = name tokens compared against file / program names (spaces, dashes, dots and underscores are ignored).",
    "strict = true  -> only flags an exact name or name + a known suffix (ui, bootstrapper, launcher, v3...). Use for short or common words.",
    "strict = false -> flags any .exe/.dll/.pf/.lnk whose name CONTAINS the token.",
    "folders = known install folders. %LocalAppData%, %AppData%, %ProgramData%, %UserProfile%, %ProgramFiles%, %ProgramFiles(x86)% are expanded for every user profile.",
    "severity: high = cheat, medium = suspicious tool, info = context only (never causes FLAGGED by itself).",
    "Generic tokens (like 'robloxexecutor') catch renamed or unknown tools. No list can catch every cheat, so the checker also looks at behavior: executor folders, deleted files, antivirus exclusions and firewall rules."
  ],
